OL,3,ADriver who killed woman celebrating
OL,4,A60th jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA speeding driver has been jailed for
OL,7,Ftwo years after he caused the death of
OL,8,Fa passenger in a taxi when he crashed
OL,9,Finto the vehicle in Leicester.
OL,11,FThomas Goulty killed grandmother Donna
OL,12,FBrighton when she was thrown from the
OL,13,Ftaxi through an open window in
OL,14,FGlenfield Road on 16 September 2023.
OL,16,FBrother and sister Steve and Andrea
OL,17,FSidsaff, who were also passengers in
OL,18,Fthe back of the taxi, were seriously
OL,19,Finjured in the collision, Leicester
OL,20,FCrown Court heard.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
